BT /F1 10 Tf 54 560 Td (4. Power connected \(PoE+ or 10-30 VDC\), not both.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 547 Td (5. Backhaul configured and gateway Online in TesseraCloud.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 534 Td (6. Mesh channel and network ID recorded.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 521 Td (7. All nodes paired, mounted at 6 N m and assigned to assets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 508 Td (8. Unused cable entries blanked; gland nuts tightened.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 495 Td (9. Firmware verified against the compatibility matrix.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 482 Td (10. Customer handover completed, including the admin password in the customer's password) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 469 Td (   vault.) Tj ET
